# NOTIFICATION DELIVERY TIME — when the bot sends messages (advance notice window).
# This is infrastructure. Do not change it in normal operation.
#
# Shift start times shown IN the message are configured in data/schedule_mapping.json
# under "shift_hours" — that is the only file IT needs for routine schedule updates.
#
# Format: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week command
# Default: daily at 07:00 UTC
# To test:  change to   * * * * *   (fires every minute — dedup prevents duplicate sends)
#
0 7 * * * python /app/main.py --production
